# Mob programs from the fixture area as mobs move, with area_update and mobile_update running, in the temple
# square (3005) and round it. The wanderer (30003) has random (50) and entry programs; Decimus (10) waits in the
# square, Heroic (51) in the market square (3014) to the south.
# - random: each mobile pulse, one in two it looks around, and does nothing else that pulse
# - entry: when it wanders into a room, it strides in (the market square, where Heroic sees it)
@place mobprog.are mobprog.are
@place area-mobprog.lst area.lst
@updates area,mobile
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
south
south
@as dec
@mob 30003 3005
@pulse 3200
@state
